  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addressing socio-economic  human security: Streamlining the role of women in peacebuilding</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Socio-economic human security is promoted through fair access to water and food
Local stakeholders across social and political divides reconciled and support a sustainable water governance system
Economic opportunities increased to prevent youth from supporting the war economy by creating short-term jobs from construction labor and long-term jobs from agriculture</narrative>
  </description>
